  "releaseNotes": "Notable Changes:\n\t\tAllow for disabling output redirection after it had been set\n\t\tFixed bug where preparing TSQL dialect statements with question-mark parameters would cause errors\n\t\tFastInsert. Change Min Timestamp to 0001-01-01\n\t\tFastInsert. Avoid unnecessary conversion of int/long value when setting POSIX field\n\t\tFastInsert. Fix String to double conversion for %Time\n\t\tFix value of POSIX_MAX_NEG\n\t\tFix bug when converting return value of UIntPtr to Int64\n\t\tMark COLLECT statement as DDL\n\t\tClose all IRISObjects on connection close regardless of pooling\n\t\tInclude only current DLL in nupkg\n\t\tGateway writeOutput to convert null to empty string\n\t\tParameter performance improvement. Add HashSet of parameter names to improve lookup time\n\t\tPrepend @ symbol to MSSQL variables on Execute\n\t\tInclude in 2.6.1 Maintenance Release:\n\t\tMC3418 - Normalize IRIS classname in Y9 message\n\t\tAdd support for Stored Procedures to return Streams",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "2.6.1",
